#: positiontab_impl.cpp:49
msgid ""
"This sets the position of the panel i.e. the screen border it is attached "
"to. You can also change this position by left-clicking on some free space on "
"the panel and dragging it to a screen border."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje se podešava smještaj panela, odnosno na koji rub će se prisloniti. "
"Također možete mijenjati njegov položaj klikom na prazni dio panela i "
"zatim povlačenjem ga smjestiti na drugi rub zaslona."

#: positiontab_impl.cpp:54
msgid ""
"This sets the size of the panel. You can also access this option via the "
"panel context menu, i.e. by right-clicking on some free space on the panel."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje se odrađuje veličina panela. Također možete veličinu mjenjati iz "
"izbornika vezanog za panel, npr. desnim klikom na slobodan dio panela."

#: positiontab_impl.cpp:58
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This setting determines how the panel is aligned, i.e. how it's positioned "
"on the panel edge. Note that in order for this setting to have any effect, "
"the panel size has to be set to a value of less than 100%"
msgstr ""

#: positiontab_impl.cpp:96 positiontab_impl.cpp:116
#, fuzzy
msgid "T&op"
msgstr "Na &vrhu"

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:56
msgid ""
"If hide buttons are enabled, check this option to make the panel softly "
"slide away when you click on the hide buttons. Otherwise it will just "
"disappear."
msgstr ""
"Ako su omogućeni gumbi za skrivanje, onda ovdje možete podesiti da panel "
"polako klizne ustranu kada ga skrivate. Ako to ne odaberete, on će "
"jednostavno nestati (što je brže, ali nije lijepo)."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:60
msgid ""
"Determines the speed of the hide animation, i.e. the animation shown when "
"you click on the panel's hide buttons."
msgstr "Određuje brzinu pokreta skrivanja, npr. "

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:63
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel will automatically hide after some time "
"and reappear when you move the mouse to the screen edge the panel is "
"attached to. This is particularly useful for small screen resolutions, for "
"example, on laptops."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje omogućavate automatsko skrivanje panela i njegovo pojavljivanje ako "
"pokazivač držite uz rub ekrana gdje se inače panel nalazi. To je posebno "
"korisno što je rezolucija vašeg zaslona manja kao npr. na laptopima."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:69
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel will automatically show itself for a "
"brief period of time when the desktop is switched so you can see which "
"desktop you are on."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odabrati da se panel nakratko pokaže prilikom prelaska na "
"drugu radnu površinu, pa možete vidjeti na kojoj površini se nalazite."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Here you can change the delay after which the panel will disappear if not "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje se mijenja zadrška, odnosno kada će se panel sakriti ako ga ne "
"koristite."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:79
msgid ""
"If auto-hide panel is enabled, check this option to make the panel softly "
"slide down after a certain amount of time. Otherwise it will just disappear."
msgstr ""
"Ako je automatsko skrivanje omogućeno, onda ovdje možete podesiti da panel "
"polagano klizne nakon nekog vremena u stranu, u suprotnom će jednoastavno "
"nestati."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:83
msgid ""
"Determines the speed of the auto-hide animation, i.e. the animation shown "
"when the panel disappears after a certain amount of time."
msgstr ""
"Određuje brzinu animacije nestajanja panela, ondnosno koliko dugo će "
"pomicanje trajati."

#: extensionstab_impl.cpp:76 hidingtab_impl.cpp:87
msgid "Here you can change the size of the hide buttons."
msgstr "Ovdje možete promjeniti veličinu gumba za skrivanje."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:58
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel will display panel buttons using tile "
"images instead of just drawing flat buttons. You can still enable or disable "
"usage of tiles for the different kinds of panel buttons, using the options "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo omogućeno, panel će prikazati gumbe sa sličicama umjesto samih "
"ravnih gumbića. Ako želite, dolje možete podesiti da neke vrste gumba "
"nemaju sličice."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:65
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the button icons are zoomed when the mouse cursor "
" is moved over them."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovdje omogućeno, ikona na gumbima će se povećati (zumirati) kada "
"je strelica pokazivača nad njom."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:71
msgid "Enable or disable the usage of a tile image for the K menu."
msgstr "Odaberite korištenje slike u pozadini K izbornika."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:72
msgid "Choose a tile image for the K menu."
msgstr "Biranje sličice za K izbornik."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:73
msgid "This is a preview of the tile that will be used for the K menu."
msgstr "Ovo je samo pogled kako će izgedati sličica za K izbornik."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:78
msgid "Enable or disable the usage of tile images for Quick Browser buttons."
msgstr "Podešavanje korištenja slika na gumbima za Brzo Biranje."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:79
msgid "Choose a tile image for Quick Browser buttons."
msgstr "Odaberite sličicu za gumbe za Brzo Biranje."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:80
msgid "This is a preview of the tile that will be used for Quick Browser buttons."
msgstr "Ovo je samo pogled kako će izgedati sličica za gumbe za Brzo Biranje."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:85
msgid ""
"Enable or disable the usage of a tile image for buttons that launch "
"applications."
msgstr "Podešavanje korištenja slika na gumbima koji pokreću programe."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:86
msgid "Choose a tile image for buttons that launch applications."
msgstr "Odaberite sličicu za gumbe za pokretanje programa."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:87
msgid ""
"This is a preview of the tile that will be used for buttons that launch "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je samo pogled kako će izgedati sličica za gumbe za pokretanje "
"programa."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:92
msgid "Enable or disable the usage of tile images for legacy application buttons."
msgstr "Podešavanje korištenja slika na gumbima drugih programa."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:93
msgid "Choose a tile image for legacy application buttons."
msgstr "Odaberite sličicu za gumbe drugih programa."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:94
msgid ""
"This is a preview of the tile that will be used for legacy application "
"buttons."
msgstr "Ovo je samo pogled kako će izgedati sličica za gumbe drugih programa."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:99
msgid "Enable or disable the usage of tile images for window list buttons."
msgstr "Podešavanje korištenja slika na gumbima sa popisom prozora."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:100
msgid "Choose a tile image for window list buttons."
msgstr "Odaberite sličicu za gumbe sa popisom prozora."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:101
msgid "This is a preview of the tile that will be used for window list buttons."
msgstr "Ovo je samo pogled kako će izgedati sličica za gumbe sa popisom prozora."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:106
msgid "Enable or disable the usage of tile images for desktop access buttons."
msgstr "Podešavanje korištenja slika na gumbima za pristup radnoj površini."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:107
msgid "Choose a tile image for desktop access buttons."
msgstr "Odaberite sličicu za gumbe za pristup radnoj površini."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:108
msgid "This is a preview of the tile that will be used for desktop access buttons."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je samo pogled kako će izgedati sličica za gumbe za pristup radnoj "
"površini."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:112
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, you can choose a background image that will be "
"displayed on the panel. If it is not selected, the default colors will be "
"used, see the 'Colors' control module."
msgstr ""
"Ako ovdje odaberete, onda možete birati sliku za pozadinu panela, a ako ne "
"odaberete, onda će se koristiti osnovna boja, koja je navedena u  modulu "
"'Boje'."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:117
msgid "This is a preview for the selected background image."
msgstr "Ovo je samo pogled kako će izgedati sličica u pozadini."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:119
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a theme to be displayed by the panel. Press the 'Browse' "
"button to choose a theme using the file dialog."
"<p> This option is only active if 'Use background theme' is selected."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje birate temu koju će pokazivati panel. Pritisnite 'Pretraži' gumb za "
"biranje teme pomoćz dijaloga. "
"<p> Ovo radi samo ako je odabrano 'Korištenje pozadinske teme'."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:125
#, fuzzy
msgid "Select an Image File"
msgstr "Izaberite sliku."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:154
msgid "Failed to load image file."
msgstr "Greška prilikom učitavanje slike."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:300 lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:303
msgid "Error loading theme image file."
msgstr "Ne mogu učitati datoteku sa slikom teme."

#: menutab_impl.cpp:69
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, hidden files (i.e. files beginning with a dot) "
"will be shown in the QuickBrowser menus."
msgstr ""
"Ako ovo omogućite, onda će sakrivene datoteke (tj. one kojima ime počinje "
"sa točkom), biti prikazane u izborniku 'Brzog Pretraživača'."

#: menutab_impl.cpp:72
msgid ""
"When browsing directories that contain a lot of files, the QuickBrowser can "
"sometimes hide your whole desktop. Here you can limit the number of entries "
"shown at a time in the QuickBrowser. This is particularly useful for low "
"screen resolutions."
msgstr ""
"Kada se krećete kroz dikrektorije koji sadrže puno datoteka, "
"BrziPretraživač može zakloniti čitavu radnu površinu. Ovdje možete "
"ograničiti broj prikazanih redova u BrzomPretraživaču, što je vrlo "
"korisno kod nižih rezolucija zaslona."

#: menutab_impl.cpp:80
msgid "Toggle menu entry details."
msgstr ""

#: menutab_impl.cpp:82
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will make the panel show a bookmarks menu in your KDE "
"menu"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete uključiti pokazivanje izbornika sa oznakama na panelu, u KDE "
"izborniku."

#: menutab_impl.cpp:85
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will make the panel show a recent documents menu in "
"your KDE menu, containing shortcuts to your most recently edited documents. "
"This assumes you've been using KDE applications to edit those documents, as "
"other applications will not be able to take advantage of this feature."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete omogućit da panel pokazuje izbornik sa prečacima do nedavno "
"korištenih dokumenata, pod pretpostavkom da ste koristili KDE programe "
"prilokom rada sa tim dokumentima, jer drugi programi ne koriste ovu "
"mogućnost."

#: menutab_impl.cpp:91
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will show the 'Quick Browser' in your KDE menu, a fast "
"way of accessing your files via submenus. You can also add a Quick Browser "
"as a panel button, using the panel context menu."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje se omogućava postavljenje 'Brzog Preglednika' u vašem KDE izborniku, "
"za brži pristup vašim podacima kroz podizobrnike. Također možete dodati "
"Brzi Preglednik kao gumb na panelu, koristeći izbornik za sadržaj panela."

#: menutab_impl.cpp:96
msgid "Add selected item"
msgstr "Dodaj odabrano"

#: menutab_impl.cpp:97
msgid "Remove selected item"
msgstr "Makni odabrano"

#: menutab_impl.cpp:98
msgid ""
"The list of available dynamic menus that can be plugged into the KDE menu. "
"Use the buttons to add or remove items."
msgstr ""
"Popis dostupnih dinamičkih izbornika koji se mogu priljučiti u KDE "
"izbornik. Koristeći gumbe možete micati i dodavati izbornike."

#: menutab_impl.cpp:101
msgid ""
"The list of selected dynamic menus that will be added to the KDE menu. Use "
"the buttons to add or remove items. "
msgstr ""
"Popis odabranih dinamičkih izbornika koji će biti dodani u KDE izbor. "
"Koristeći gumbe možete ih dodati ili maknuti."

#: extensionstab_impl.cpp:58
msgid ""
"This sets the position of the panel extension i.e. the screen border it is "
"attached to. You can also change this position by left-clicking on some free "
"space on the panel extension and dragging it to a screen border."
msgstr ""
"Ovo podešava poziciju dodatka panela, odnosno ruba zaslona na koji je on "
"priljubljen, što također možete mijenjati, duplim klikom na slobodni "
"prostor dodatka panela i povlačenjem na rub zaslona."

#: extensionstab_impl.cpp:63
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel extension will automatically hide after "
"some time and reappear when you move the mouse to the screen edge the panel "
"extension is attached to. This is particularly useful for small screen "
"resolutions, for example, on laptops."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete uključiti automatsko skrivanje i pojavljivanje dodatka panela "
"ako ga ne koristite neko vrijeme, odnosno ako pokazivač bude blizu ruba "
"zaslona, što je korisno na manjim rezolucijama, kao npr. kod laptopa."

#: extensionstab_impl.cpp:69
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel extension will automatically show "
"itself for a brief period of time when the desktop is switched so you can "
"see which desktop you are on."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete uljučiti kratko pojavljivanje panela prilikom prebacivanje "
"radnih površina tako da se možete orijentirati na kojoj trenutno radite."

#: extensionstab_impl.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Here you can change the delay after which the panel extension will disappear "
"if not used."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete promjeniti kašnjenje nakon kojeg će se dodatak panela "
"maknuti, ako ge ne koristite."

